  "description": "<p>⭐ <em><strong>Cheers for Cabaret!</strong> is a glamorous cabaret spectacular in London at The Phoenix Arts Club, ushering in a bold new era of theatrical nightlife in the heart of Soho.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Highlights</b><br>\r\n🥂 Experience champagne-fuelled burlesque, dazzling drag, and riotous character comedy<br>\r\n✨ Be wowed by jaw-dropping variety acts from top-tier international performers<br>\r\n🎭 Soak up the velvet-drenched atmosphere of Theatreland at the legendary Phoenix Arts Club<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>General Info</b><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: Select your preferred date and time at checkout (throughout 2026)<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: Approximately 2 hours<br>\r\n📍 Location: Phoenix Arts Club, One Phoenix Street, London, WC2H 8BU<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 18+<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: Not wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Description</b><br>\r\nLondon, raise your glass — a new era of cabaret has arrived. Cheers for Cabaret! is a high-spirited celebration of all things theatrical, taking over the iconic Phoenix Arts Club throughout 2026. Set against a backdrop of velvet interiors and vintage show posters, this unforgettable night blends the heritage of Theatreland with the rebellious flair of Soho. Expect burlesque dripping in glamour, show-stopping drag, bold comedy, and electrifying variety acts performed by world-class talent who know exactly how to turn a performance into a party. With over 500,000 guests having enjoyed the venue’s cabaret productions and a TripAdvisor Certificate of Excellence to its name, this is your invitation to pour, clink, toast — and step into a night of pure razzle-dazzle.</p>",
